。","start":42.114,"end":44.509,"readings":[{"word":"知っ","reading":"しっ","offset":2}]},{"id":"sentence-13","text":"知ってます。","start":44.509,"end":46.306,"readings":[{"word":"知っ","reading":"しっ","offset":0}]},{"id":"sentence-14","text":"みんな日本語の勉強を頑張っています。","start":46.306,"end":51.695,"readings":[{"word":"日本語","reading":"にほんご","offset":3},{"word":"勉強","reading":"べんきょう","offset":7},{"word":"頑張っ","reading":"がんばっ","offset":10}]},{"id":"sentence-15","text":"もちろんもう本当にそれは分かります。","start":51.695,"end":57.085,"readings":[{"word":"本当に","reading":"ほんとうに","offset":6},{"word":"分かり","reading":"わかり","offset":12}]},{"id":"sentence-16","text":"はい。","start":57.085,"end":57.983,"readings":[]},{"id":"sentence-17","text":"でも私は今日本語の先生です。","start":57.983,"end":62.175,"readings":[{"word":"私","reading":"わたし","offset":2},{"word":"今","reading":"こん","offset":4},{"word":"日本語","reading":"にほんご","offset":5},{"word":"先生","reading":"せんせい","offset":9}]},{"id":"sentence-18","text":"で、私の生徒はみんな頑張って日本語を勉強しています。","start":62.175,"end":69.96,"readings":[{"word":"私","reading":"わたし","offset":2},{"word":"生徒","reading":"せいと","offset":4},{"word":"頑張っ","reading":"がんばっ","offset":10},{"word":"日本語","reading":"にほんご","offset":14},{"word":"勉強","reading":"べんきょう","offset":18}]},{"id":"sentence-19","text":"でもみんな話すのが1番難しいと言っています。","start":69.96,"end":79.92,"readings":[{"word":"話す","reading":"はなす","offset":5},{"word":"番","reading":"ばん","offset":10},{"word":"難しい","reading":"むずかしい","offset":11},{"word":"言っ","reading":"いっ","offset":15}]},{"id":"sentence-20","text":"日本語を話したいですよね。","start":79.92,"end":84.759,"readings":[{"word":"日本語","reading":"にほんご","offset":0},{"word":"話し","reading":"はなし","offset":4}]},{"id":"sentence-21","text":"でも日本語を話すのが1番難しいんですよそう。","start":84.759,"end":91.49,"readings":[{"word":"日本語","reading":"にほんご","offset":2},{"word":"話す","reading":"はなす","offset":6},{"word":"番","reading":"ばん","offset":11},{"word":"難しい","reading":"むずかしい","offset":12}]},{"id":"sentence-22","text":"ま、多分文法を勉強します。","start":91.49,"end":95.468,"read